# Fires counts spells cast earlier in the turn and prevents its controller from casting a third spell or casting during the opponent's turn (CR 601.2e).
# Its free cast is its controller's alone: Bot2, with one Island, may not cast its one-mana Shock that way (CR 118.9).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Fires of Invention
Ornithopter
Shock
Mountain
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Shock
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
